# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Procedural Detective — LOCAL DETERMINISTIC DEVELOPMENT profile (Phase 24 §8).
#
#     copy compose/profiles/dev.env .env        (optional; values also match
#     docker compose up --build                  the .env.example defaults)
